01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:02.476
We want to remove every barrier
standing between your imagination and reality.

01:25:02.916 --> 01:25:10.556
So you don't have to accept the limitations
of today as the boundaries of tomorrow.

01:25:11.236 --> 01:25:15.596
Please continue to be curious. Continue to invent.

01:25:16.036 --> 01:25:23.876
Most importantly, continue to build
because we're here to build a remarkable future.

01:25:24.436 --> 01:25:30.356
I've always said I will continue
saying the best is always yet to come.

01:25:30.916 --> 01:25:33.356
Thank you. And please enjoy the summit.

